    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A simple plugin that disables the notification email sent to the admin, only when a new user account is registered.<br />\nFor use it, simple activate it!</p>\n<p>If you like this plugin, please consider leaving a comment or review.</p>\n<h3>Github Repo</h3>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a link to the Github Repo <a href=\"https://github.com/Ashyzan/disable-admin-email\" title=\"Github Repo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">githublink</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Click &#8220;Plugins&#8221; &gt; &#8220;Add New&#8221; in the WordPress admin menu.</li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;Disable Admin Email&#8221;.</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Install Now&#8221;.</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Activate Plugin&#8221;.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Alternatively, you can manually upload the plugin to your wp-content/plugins directory.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20it%20works%3F'>\nHow it works?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>For use it, simple activate it!</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
